  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse multisectorielle aux besoins vitaux en sant&#xE9; sexuelle, reproductive et aux violences bas&#xE9;es sur le genre dans les r&#xE9;gions du centre et du nord affect&#xE9;es par la crise au Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide critical protection and reproductive health services to vulnerable people affected by conflict-related displacement. This UNFPA project provides access to lifesaving sexual and reproductive health services, GBV services as well as multi-purpose cash assistance to women, men, girls and boys affected by or at risk of gender-based violence . The project provides humanitarian assistance to 13,767 people, including 8,159 women, 4,978 children, and 184 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
